1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,500
Social media platforms today struggle with spam,
low-quality comments, and predatory algorithms.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:09,500
Creators bring all the engagement,
but platform owners capture almost all the monetization.

3
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:14,000
At the same time, users leave generic comments
just to chase attention without adding real value.

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:20,500
Introducing Pinata, a decentralized social platform built on Solana.

5
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:27,000
We align incentives between creators and followers
by introducing micro-transactions for meaningful interactions.

6
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:32,500
Posting is free, but commenting requires a small fee.

7
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:39,000
This drastically reduces spam and rewards high-value engagement.

8
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:46,500
When a user pays to comment,
the fee is split between platform sustainability and the creator.

9
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:55,000
To make interactions more fun and rewarding,
a portion of these fees fuels two gamified prize pools called Piñatas.

10
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:04,000
The Platform Piñata is funded by platform fees
and is drawn once a month for active users.

11
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:14,000
The Creator Piñata is accumulated on the creator's profile,
and once the creator reaches 50% of the target,
they can pop the Piñata.

12
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:22,500
This distributes the accumulated rewards
to the community members who contributed to the discussion.

13
00:01:22,500 --> 00:01:31,000
For this hackathon, we built and deployed
a fully functional Web MVP on Vercel.

14
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:40,000
The current build demonstrates the full UI flow
using simulated wallet interactions.

15
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:50,000
This prepares the foundation for direct integration
with Solana smart contracts and PDAs on Devnet.

16
00:01:50,000 --> 00:02:00,000
We are building a sustainable,
anti-spam, and gamified social ecosystem.

17
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:10,000
Check out our live frontend demo
and join us in reshaping Web3 social dynamics on Solana.
